{'symbol': 'SHW', 'date': '2019-10-21 22:30:00', 'title': 'THE SHERWIN-WILLIAMS COMPANY PROVIDES CONSOLIDATED EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR ENDING DECEMBER 31, 2019', 'text': "THE SHERWIN-WILLIAMS COMPANY PROVIDED CONSOLIDATED EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR ENDING DECEMBER 31, 2019. FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER, THE COMPANY ANTICIPATES CONSOLIDATED NET SALES WILL INCREASE BY A LOW SINGLE DIGIT PERCENTAGE COMPARED TO LAST YEAR'S FOURTH QUARTER.FOR THE FULL YEAR 2019, THE COMPANY EXPECTS CONSOLIDATED NET SALES WILL INCREASE BY A LOW SINGLE DIGIT PERCENTAGE COMPARED TO THE FULL YEAR 2018. THE COMPANY IS UPDATING FULL YEAR 2019 DILUTED NET INCOME PER SHARE GUIDANCE TO BE IN THE RANGE OF $17.07 TO $17.47 PER SHARE."}